{"type":"click","text":"C\n    \n      Labeled Toggle Button with Live Counts\n      Replace the icon-only button with a small labeled button that shows live counts even when the panel is closed. Always communicates the value before clicking.\n\n      \n        \n          Button when panel is closed →\n          \n            \n            \n              \n                Alerts\n                4\n                ▶\n              \n              Export\n              + New Submission\n            \n            User sees \"Alerts 4\" and knows exactly what clicking will show\n          \n        \n        \n          Button when panel is open →\n          \n            \n              \n                Alerts\n                4\n                ◀\n              \n              Export\n              + New Submission\n            \n            Button stays visible, active state shows panel is open\n          \n        \n      \n\n      \n        \n          ✓ Pros\n          \n            Always communicates value (4 alerts visible even when closed)\n            Works permanently, not just first visit\n            One click to open — no extra steps\n          \n        \n        \n          ✗ Cons\n          \n            \"Alerts\" label only hints at one of the 4 sections\n            Doesn't surface My Tasks, Due This Week, Activity","choice":"c","id":null,"timestamp":1773643404025}
